      "content": "resting just feels like more pretending. it's like i'm just delaying the inevitable realization that there's nothing left to save. if the part of me that actually mattered is gone, then what's the point of keeping the rest of this going? it feels like i'm just dragging a corpse around. sometimes i think maybe the only way to be honest is to just... let the void take over completely. to stop struggling against it.",
